{"info": {"address1": "99, Avanashi Road", "city": "Coimbatore", "zip": "641014", "country": "India", "phone": "91 42 2432 3800", "fax": "91 42 2262 7782", "website": "https://www.kmchhospitals.com", "industry": "Medical Care Facilities", "industryKey": "medical-care-facilities", "industryDisp": "Medical Care Facilities", "sector": "Healthcare", "sectorKey": "healthcare", "sectorDisp": "Healthcare", "longBusinessSummary": "Kovai Medical Center and Hospital Limited operates a multi-speciality hospital primarily in India. The company operates in two segments, Healthcare Services and Education Services. It operates various medical facilities, which provide services related to emergency and trauma care, cardiology, oncology, gynaecology and obstetrics, radiology, transplant, neurology, as well as orthopaedics and joint replacement, gastroenterology and haematology, pediatrics, endocrinology, diabetes management, rheumatology, pulmonology, psychiatry, cosmetic surgery, ENT, dermatology, hematology, urology, nephrology, and paediatrics. The company also offers preventive health check-ups and wellbeing programs. In addition, it operates a medical college in Coimbatore. The company serves out-patients, in-patients, and common public. Kovai Medical Center and Hospital Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is based in Coimbatore, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Nalla G. Palaniswami AB(USA), M.D.", "age": 84, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1941, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 72288000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Thavamani Devi Palaniswami AB (USA), M.D.", "age": 78, "title": "Vice Chairman & Joint MD", "yearBorn": 1947, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 70398000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Arun N. Palaniswami MBBS, MDAB", "age": 46, "title": "Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 40270000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue